// Movement rules that are not a property of one unit archetype.
//
// `group_routing.lane_tolerance_permille`: group-consistent routing (plan
// `docs/plans/2026-11-10-group-routing.md`, D-7; owner answer Q0079, option 2; sanctioned
// deviation S-7 of plan `2026-11-05-sc2-deviation-fixes`). Ground units given one Move or
// AttackMove command together take the lane (the side of every terrain obstacle) of the
// group's leader whenever that route is at most this many thousandths longer than the unit's
// own shortest route. 0 switches the rule off: every unit routes on its own, as in
// StarCraft II. Allowed range 0 to 1000.
(
    group_routing: (
        lane_tolerance_permille: 0,
    ),
)
